{
  "slug": "dataproc",
  "name": "Dataproc",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage Dataproc clusters and jobs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `dataproc`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dataproc@claude-plugins-official` from `gemini-cli-extensions/dataproc`.\n\nThis repository packages MCP Toolbox's prebuilt `dataproc` server as a plugin/extension to interact with Dataproc clusters and jobs. It can be used with various AI agents, including Antigravity, Claude Code and Codex, to manage your clusters, monitor jobs, and troubleshoot issues using natural language prompts.",
